  "system": {
    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-rusting-current",
    "description": "<p>You create a current of steam, expanding and firing it forward like a train barreling forward. All creatures in a 30-foot long, 5-foot-wide line must make a Dexterity saving throw.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creature takes half of 2d10 acid damage.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creature takes half of 2d10 acid damage. This damage ignores temporary hit points and DR a creature has.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creature takes 2d10 acid damage and also cannot gain bonus DR or Temporary hit points before the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but affected creature takes 4d10 acid damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d10.</p>",
    "source": {
